      ],
      "dcterms:description": "Legendary artifact horn carved from dragonbone and hearthstone. When blown, each character gets to place a friendly skeleton in their room or corridor in line of sight. Skeletons have movement 8, attack 2, defend 2, body 1, mind 0. They become new characters that take their turns immediately following their hero counterpart.",
